{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12729","headline":"题严陵钓台 · 张继","name":"题严陵钓台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧隐人如在，清风亦似秋。\n客星沈夜壑，钓石俯春流。\n鸟向乔枝聚，鱼依浅濑游。\n古来芳饵下，谁是不吞钩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张继","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12729.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12729","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}